msgstr "Until you renew it, your firm can't file taxes or access your notifications on your behalf."

msgid "Mientras no se renueve, no se pueden presentar impuestos ni acceder a notificaciones con él."
msgstr "Until it's renewed, no taxes can be filed nor notifications accessed with it."

msgid "Más datos (opcional)"
msgstr "More details (optional)"

