msgstr "Fills in the tax profile, tags and initial tasks. Anything you set by hand below takes priority over the template."

msgid "Gestionar plantillas de cliente"
msgstr "Manage client templates"

msgid "Plantillas de cliente"
msgstr "Client templates"

